# Snowflake Database Design

## Database

RETAIL_DW

## Schemas

### RAW
Landing area for source-system data.

- RAW_CUSTOMERS
- RAW_PRODUCTS
- RAW_STORES
- RAW_ORDERS
- RAW_ORDER_ITEMS
- RAW_PAYMENTS

### STAGING
Cleaned and standardized source data.

- STG_CUSTOMERS
- STG_PRODUCTS
- STG_STORES
- STG_ORDERS
- STG_ORDER_ITEMS
- STG_PAYMENTS

### ANALYTICS
Business-ready dimensional model.

- DIM_DATE
- DIM_CUSTOMER
- DIM_PRODUCT
- DIM_STORE
- FACT_SALES
- FACT_PAYMENTS

## Data Flow

Oracle / S3
    ↓
RAW
    ↓
STAGING
    ↓
DBT transformations
    ↓
ANALYTICS
    ↓
Power BI
